-1-Q29\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"T-old-1-Q7\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"C-old-1-Q34\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"T-old-2-Q16\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"C-old-2-Q33\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"T-old-2-Q29\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"C-old-2-Q28\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"T-old-2-Q6\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"C-old-2-Q32\": {\n  \"hidden\": false,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"T-old-2-Q9\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"C-old-2-Q15\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"T-old-3-Q14\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"C-old-3-Q4\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"T-old-3-Q23\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"C-old-3-Q5\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"T-old-3-Q3\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"C-old-3-Q49\": {\n  \"hidden\": false,\n  \"had_previous\": false\n },\n \"T-old-3-Q33\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"C-old-3-Q31\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"T-old-3-Q37\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"C-old-3-Q1\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"T-old-3-Q41\": {\n  \"hidden\": false,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"C-old-3-Q35\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"T-old-3-Q7\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n },\n \"C-old-3-Q15\": {\n  \"hidden\": true,\n  \"had_previous\": true\n }\n}docs/DECISIONS.md:231:- A judgement reads the evidence in view (D198): the arrivals since its fifth most recent judgement and the basis its last ten cited; the\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:383:| D38 | 2026-10-20 | The views database rebuilt: a view is a question with a five-rung ladder and a due date | in force (amended by D42, D45, D46, D51, D54, D57, D58, D185, D186, D198, D260) | §7 Thesis library |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:387:| D42 | 2026-10-20 | Extraction hands over evidence and candidate views as two things; evidence is matched to what its view alre… | in force (amended by D45, D58, D59, D198, D202, D204, D207, D264, D360, D364) | §6 Extraction |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:391:| D46 | 2026-10-20 | Alex decides Claude's views proposals one by one | in force (amended by D51, D54, D58, D63, D155, D169, D185, D191, D197, D198, D202, D204) | §7 Thesis library |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:542:| D198 | 2026-10-27 | A judgement reads the evidence in view, not everything in force | in force | §7 Thesis library |\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2559:## D198 · 2026-10-27 · A judgement reads the evidence in view, not everything in force\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2573:- The three-month run restarts from 2026-07-01 with poc-v32 on the cleaned database (D256) in `poc/data/english-v32-nvda-3m-2026-10-27/`; the poc-v29/v30 run stays paused and untouched. Open, named: links read widely (every piece to three or four theses; D198's \"\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3172:`main` and `fix/extraction-quality-2026-10-28` both numbered from D181 after D170. At the merge the branch kept its numbers (D171–D274) and the 62 decisions `main` recorded were renumbered in order: D181→D275, D182→D276, D183→D277, D184→D278, D185→D279, D186→D280\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3735:  1. **No separate final review before closing.** Each day's judgement already reads the evidence in force (D198's window), so a review at\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:4871:## D439 · 2026-11-13 · While Alex is not active, the council decides by consensus and the loop iterates to the PRD's production goals\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:7087:  candidate to size; D198's reason stands); the history report's counts as verified.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:9526:    - the three-month runs (v29-3m, v34-3m) and the run3 family were served as the product, but their traces drove changes: D151, D198,\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:10125:## D681 · 2026-11-20 · Alex opens the hybrid system's build and test; phase 1 is a new judge version (J2) for the judge's reasoning errors\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
